1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,240
Shorts Blocker Kids helps parents block
short-video feeds on a child's phone.

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,700
Here is how setup and protection work.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,600
First, create a parent PIN and choose the
apps to protect.

4
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:13,240
This demonstration uses YouTube.

5
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:18,160
Before asking for Android permission, the
app explains why it needs the Accessibility

6
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:18,940
service.

7
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:23,620
It detects supported short-video screens and
displays a blocking overlay.

8
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,780
The explanation also describes how data is
handled.

9
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,800
Detection runs locally on this phone.

10
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:33,700
The app does not collect or send watch
history, messages, video titles, or screen

11
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:34,560
recordings.

12
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:37,820
Protection settings and the parent PIN stay
on the device.

13
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:40,380
The full disclosure is visible as we scroll.

14
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:44,040
The parent can read everything before
deciding whether to continue.

15
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:48,280
Blocking requires both protection and the
Accessibility service to be enabled.

16
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,000
Consent is optional.

17
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:52,940
Selecting Not now returns to the dashboard.

18
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:56,180
The service is still disabled, so blocking is not
active.

19
00:00:57,280 --> 00:01:01,840
From the dashboard, the parent can reopen
the explanation, review it, and choose I agree

20
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:02,700
and continue.

21
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:07,300
Next, in Android's Accessibility settings, turn
on Shorts Blocker Kids Protection.

22
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:10,140
Read the system warning and tap Allow to
confirm.

23
00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:12,320
The switch now shows On.

24
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:15,460
With the service enabled, a regular YouTube
video still plays.

25
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:18,840
The personal content below the player is
hidden in this recording.

26
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,440
Opening Shorts brings up the blocking
screen.

27
00:01:21,740 --> 00:01:23,620
Temporary access requires the parent PIN.

28
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:25,720
The other supported apps are not shown.
